sequenceDiagram
    participant Producer as Producer Client
    participant Redis as Redis / Valkey<br/>6379/TCP RESP<br/>Optional TLS
    participant AP as Async Processor<br/>llm-d-async
    participant Gate as Dispatch Gate<br/>(Prometheus / Redis / Local)
    participant IGW as llm-d-router<br/>(Inference Gateway)<br/>HTTP/1.1 Optional TLS
    participant Consumer as Consumer Client

    Note over Producer, Consumer: Flow 1: Redis Sorted Set Request Processing

    Producer->>Redis: ZADD request to sorted set<br/>RESP, Optional TLS, URL credentials
    AP->>Redis: ZPOPMIN poll (dequeue request)<br/>RESP, Optional TLS, URL credentials
    AP->>Gate: Budget check (admit/refuse/wait)
    Gate-->>AP: Admission decision + budget

    alt Gate admits request
        AP->>IGW: POST inference request<br/>HTTP/1.1, Optional TLS 1.2+
        IGW-->>AP: Inference response<br/>HTTP/1.1, Optional TLS 1.2+
        AP->>Redis: LPUSH result to result list<br/>RESP, Optional TLS, URL credentials
        Consumer->>Redis: BRPOP result<br/>RESP, Optional TLS, URL credentials
    else Gate refuses (retriable)
        Note over AP: Wait-on-Refuse decorator<br/>parks request until budget available
        AP->>Gate: Re-check budget
        Gate-->>AP: Admitted
        AP->>IGW: POST inference request
        IGW-->>AP: Response
        AP->>Redis: LPUSH result
    end

    Note over Producer, Consumer: Flow 2: GCP Pub/Sub Request Processing

    participant GCPReq as GCP Pub/Sub<br/>Request Topic<br/>443/TCP gRPC TLS
    participant GCPRes as GCP Pub/Sub<br/>Result Topic<br/>443/TCP gRPC TLS
    participant GCPMon as GCP Cloud Monitoring<br/>443/TCP gRPC TLS

    Producer->>GCPReq: Publish request message<br/>gRPC, TLS, GCP IAM
    AP->>GCPReq: Receive (subscription pull)<br/>gRPC, TLS, GCP workload identity
    AP->>Gate: Budget check
    opt GCP Pub/Sub gated mode
        AP->>GCPMon: Query num_undelivered_messages<br/>gRPC, TLS, GCP workload identity
    end
    Gate-->>AP: Admitted
    AP->>IGW: POST inference request<br/>HTTP/1.1, Optional TLS 1.2+
    IGW-->>AP: Inference response
    AP->>GCPRes: Publish result message<br/>gRPC, TLS, GCP workload identity

    Note over AP, Redis: Flow 3: Retry Processing (Redis)

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over AP: Inference failure detected
        AP->>AP: Enqueue to retry channel<br/>(in-process Go channel)
        AP->>Redis: ZADD to retry sorted set<br/>score = now + backoff_duration<br/>RESP, Optional TLS
        loop Retry poll
            AP->>Redis: ZRANGEBYSCORE (due messages via Lua)<br/>RESP, Optional TLS
            Redis-->>AP: Due retry messages
        end
        AP->>Redis: Re-PUBLISH to request queue<br/>RESP, Optional TLS
    end
